:R-HSA-9818025  a           obo:GO_0008150 , owl:NamedIndividual ;
        rdfs:comment        "Sub-pathway representing TCA cycle genes regulated by NFE2L2. NFE2L2 has a role in directing cellular metabolic processes in normal and cancer cells. By regulating the TCA-specific genes, it controls the progression of the TCA cycle in stress and disease conditions (DeBlasi et al, 2020; Okazaki et al, 2020)" ;
